    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry FitzGerald proudly introduces to the market this contemporary, high-specification one bedroom, first floor apartment situated in the renowned Beechwood Court development just off the Stillorgan Road. Presented in immaculate condition, this apartment is within easy reach of Blackrock and Stillorgan, Leopardstown and Sandyford Business Parks, the QBC, Luas and M50 and within only 8km of the city centre. Number 306 is a property which is sure to suit all purchasers early viewing is advised! \r\n\r\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises; entrance hall, large shelved storage room, shelved hot press, open plan kitchen/living/dining room, double bedroom and large bathroom. There is a sizeable balcony which benefits from the evening sun, offering an ideal space for dining 'al fresco'. The Beechwood Court development provides secure underground designated car parking and visitor parking. \r\n\r\nPresented in very good condition, Apt 306 is situated in a peaceful and prime location within the development which is set in a much sought after location off the N11, Beechwood Court is ideally located on the QBC with excellent bus services to the city centre and the Luas at Sandyford is a short walk away. The apartment is within walking distance of Stillorgan, Dundrum, Blackrock and Foxrock villages. It is located on one of the main arterial routes into Dublin City Centre with easy access to the M50, Dublin Airport and surrounding counties. The area is host to a wealth of amenities including local shops, Dundrum Town Centre, Leopardstown Racecourse and UCD Belfield to name but a few. There are excellent schools in the area including St. Brigids, Hollypark, Carysfort, Loreto, Blackrock college and St Andrews College."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Utility/Storage Room - 1.94m x 0.65m\r\nLarge storage area for washing machine and excellent storage space.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 3.43m x 1.02m\r\nWith wooden flooring, recessed lighting and a very large storage room.\r\n\r\nLiving/ Dining Room - 4.72m x 3.44m\r\nLarge, bright open plan living/ dining area with wooden flooring, recessed lighting and floor to ceiling windows with door leading to large balcony.\r\n\r\nBalcony - 1.51m x 6.35m\r\nLarge balcony overlooking communal gardens the ideal space for al fresco dining..\r\n\r\nKitchen - 1.94m x 2.92m\r\nFully fitted kitchen with high gloss floor and wall cupboards with granite worktops and integrated appliances. Tiled floor and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom - 4.05m x 3.15m\r\nLarge bright bedroom with wooden flooring, recessed lighting ane excellent built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.61m x 1.95m\r\nFully tiled, bath with shower over, wall hung wc and wash hand basin with mirror over."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Bright one bedroom apartment on first floor.</li><li>Very well presented.</li><li>Close to all good transport links.</li><li>Large balcony.</li><li>Communal gardens.</li><li>Designated parking space.</li><li>Lift.</li><li>GFCH.</li><li>Service Charge: 2,715.15</li></ul>"
      },
